Magaling kang magsalita ng laro.

00:32:29.160 --> 00:32:30.640
Kung may mangyaring hindi maganda, kaya mo bang buhatin ito?

00:32:30.640 --> 00:32:31.590
Maglakad.

00:32:33.720 --> 00:32:34.780
Bantayan mo kung paano ka magsalita.

00:32:36.400 --> 00:32:38.000
Inimbitahan namin si Hongbao rito
